WEBVTT

00:01:08.860 --> 00:01:10.980
SWORD GAI

00:01:21.160 --> 00:01:22.120
<i>Kill.</i>

00:01:23.040 --> 00:01:24.000
<i>Kill!</i>

00:02:19.090 --> 00:02:20.050
Bloodlust.

00:02:25.890 --> 00:02:26.850
Sayaka!

00:02:29.100 --> 00:02:30.060
Sayaka!

00:02:33.980 --> 00:02:35.900
What happened?

00:03:14.020 --> 00:03:16.070
So you're Marcus Lithos.

00:03:16.940 --> 00:03:18.860
A new Chrysalis?

00:03:19.440 --> 00:03:22.200
Yes, his Core Alma is the Azoth Sword.

00:03:22.570 --> 00:03:27.040
Oh? The one that belonged to the wizard,
where the devil Beelzebub may dwell?

00:03:27.990 --> 00:03:29.910
-Splendid.
-U-Um...

00:03:30.750 --> 00:03:35.250
Don't worry.
They're the ones who run the Shoshidai.

00:03:36.210 --> 00:03:39.300
You'll be under their protection
from now on.

00:03:39.380 --> 00:03:40.670
O-Okay.

00:03:41.430 --> 00:03:42.840
Welcome, Marcus Lithos.

00:03:43.930 --> 00:03:45.680
Welcome, Marcus Lithos.

00:03:46.050 --> 00:03:48.140
Welcome, Marcus Lithos.

00:03:48.600 --> 00:03:49.560
Th-Thanks.

00:03:50.350 --> 00:03:53.900
U-Um, why isn't Miki with us?

00:03:54.480 --> 00:03:56.480
It'll be okay. You'll see him soon.

00:03:57.320 --> 00:04:00.110
He has things to take care of as well.

00:04:03.950 --> 00:04:07.240
How is the Alma looking
compared to the last scan data?

00:04:07.990 --> 00:04:12.580
The transformation has increased by 2%,
but no other changes detected.

00:04:13.040 --> 00:04:16.250
I see. Though it always amazes me.

00:04:16.920 --> 00:04:21.880
Weapons within a body gradually lose their
structure, but can still be photographed.

00:04:22.380 --> 00:04:24.220
Like a ghost, isn't it?

00:04:31.270 --> 00:04:33.980
There's nothing to be afraid of,
Marcus Lithos.

00:04:34.440 --> 00:04:37.900
We will take full responsibility
of your well being.

00:04:38.690 --> 00:04:43.740
We at the Shoshidai are researching
the method weapons use to possess people.

00:04:44.200 --> 00:04:46.320
If we are successful,

00:04:46.410 --> 00:04:50.450
we may be able to change you from
a Chrysalis back into a normal person.

00:04:50.990 --> 00:04:54.370
If that happens, you need not worry
about becoming a Busoma.

00:04:54.870 --> 00:04:58.630
Do you remember what happened
when the Azoth Sword possessed you?

00:04:58.960 --> 00:05:00.380
U-Um...

00:05:00.460 --> 00:05:02.630
Relax and answer clearly.

00:05:04.720 --> 00:05:09.260
I-I'm not really sure.
The next thing I knew, I was holding it.

00:05:14.390 --> 00:05:18.810
And then the sword felt
like it was merging with my body.

00:05:18.900 --> 00:05:20.110
Splendid.

00:05:21.360 --> 00:05:25.740
In a way, you Chrysalises lead
to a new possibilty for humanity's future.

00:05:26.360 --> 00:05:30.080
What future that is, we don't know.

00:05:30.620 --> 00:05:35.500
You'll work with us for a better future,
won't you, Marcus Lithos?

00:05:37.420 --> 00:05:39.290
There's no need to respond.

00:05:39.790 --> 00:05:41.840
The answer is decided.

00:05:42.590 --> 00:05:46.260
Indeed.
We're the only ones who can save you.

00:05:46.340 --> 00:05:50.550
And so,
you may be able to save humanity.

00:05:51.510 --> 00:05:54.020
<i>Save humanity?</i>

00:05:56.270 --> 00:05:58.480
-We shouldn't, Naoki.
-It's fine.

00:05:58.850 --> 00:06:01.610
But your examination isn't finished yet.

00:06:01.820 --> 00:06:03.320
Just one more time, then.

00:06:10.200 --> 00:06:12.330
When will we see each other again?

00:06:13.410 --> 00:06:14.240
Well...

00:06:14.740 --> 00:06:17.250
I'm not really sure.

00:06:18.040 --> 00:06:21.540
I don't even know
how long I'll be able to stay human.

00:06:21.630 --> 00:06:23.040
Don't say that.

00:06:23.710 --> 00:06:28.510
The Shoshidai's research is progressing.
You'll return to normal someday, I'm sure.

00:06:29.130 --> 00:06:30.090
I hope so.

00:06:30.800 --> 00:06:35.270
But what I'm really worried about is you,
Mina.

00:06:35.810 --> 00:06:36.980
What do you mean?

00:06:38.980 --> 00:06:42.980
I mean you ending up
with another man while I'm asleep.

00:06:43.060 --> 00:06:44.400
I wouldn't...

00:06:44.480 --> 00:06:48.950
I'm always thinking about you, Naoki.
We can see each other in our dreams.

00:06:49.650 --> 00:06:52.280
But... I can't see you in my dreams.

00:06:53.280 --> 00:06:56.290
You don't dream
when sleeping inside the capsule.

00:06:57.080 --> 00:06:59.960
You just fall into an endless darkness.

00:07:05.840 --> 00:07:07.840
Sorry, that got dark.

00:07:08.340 --> 00:07:11.340
You're right.
Someday I'll return to normal.

00:07:11.890 --> 00:07:14.600
When that happens,
let's go on a normal date.

00:07:14.680 --> 00:07:18.180
We can go see a movie,
get some food, or go for a walk.

00:07:18.850 --> 00:07:23.230
And then, we'll have a long kiss
worthy of the Guinness Records.

00:07:24.190 --> 00:07:26.940
Yeah, I'm sure that day will come.

00:07:30.700 --> 00:07:32.320
Yes, this is Miki. What's up?

00:07:32.990 --> 00:07:34.200
Yes.

00:07:34.780 --> 00:07:35.740
I understand.

00:07:36.160 --> 00:07:37.240
Is something wrong?

00:07:37.330 --> 00:07:40.750
Yeah, Kyoka wants me
to come to the armory.

00:07:41.460 --> 00:07:43.920
Marcus is by himself and feeling nervous.

00:07:44.460 --> 00:07:45.840
That kid.

00:07:46.250 --> 00:07:49.050
He can't help it. He's new.

00:07:51.050 --> 00:07:52.010
Mina.

00:07:54.680 --> 00:07:57.310
Nothing that'll get us
into the Guinness Records.

00:09:04.000 --> 00:09:06.830
I've sighted a Busoma
within the Maldicion field.

00:09:11.670 --> 00:09:12.630
Miki!

00:09:13.090 --> 00:09:14.510
I missed you!

00:09:19.430 --> 00:09:20.390
Hey now.

00:09:36.990 --> 00:09:37.910
What's this?

00:09:43.040 --> 00:09:46.290
These are the weapons
the Shoshidai has recovered.

00:09:48.750 --> 00:09:49.580
What's wrong?

00:09:49.880 --> 00:09:51.880
<i>Emergency message from Shoshidai HQ.</i>

00:09:51.960 --> 00:09:54.460
<i>A new Busoma
<i>and Chrysalis have been sighted.</i></i>

00:09:54.550 --> 00:09:56.930
<i>A heavy mobile unit from HQ is en route.</i>

00:09:57.090 --> 00:09:58.550
Roger. Miki.

00:09:59.010 --> 00:10:00.100
Take care of him.

00:10:05.100 --> 00:10:06.850
Initiating forced recon.

00:10:14.690 --> 00:10:16.950
Busoma has fled. Pursuing!

00:10:39.130 --> 00:10:40.640
What's going on?

00:10:41.890 --> 00:10:43.300
Is he a Chrysalis?

00:10:44.060 --> 00:10:44.890
Or...

00:10:45.470 --> 00:10:47.520
HQ is requesting Chrysalis support.

00:10:48.230 --> 00:10:51.190
What do we do? Use Naoki Miki again?

00:10:52.020 --> 00:10:54.820
No, he's worked more than enough.

00:10:55.730 --> 00:10:58.530
Yes, at times like this,
we can count on...

00:11:16.210 --> 00:11:17.170
Gai!

00:11:20.800 --> 00:11:22.050
Gai!

00:11:23.390 --> 00:11:24.220
Father!

00:11:29.600 --> 00:11:30.440
Gai!

00:11:31.900 --> 00:11:33.100
Gai, what's wrong?

00:11:37.150 --> 00:11:38.400
Father, your hands!

00:11:39.400 --> 00:11:41.490
The Shiryu's gone mad!

00:11:41.950 --> 00:11:48.080
Is the endless rage within it
trying to drag his soul into the darkness?

00:11:52.000 --> 00:11:52.830
Gai.

00:11:55.000 --> 00:11:55.840
Gai!

00:12:13.020 --> 00:12:16.020
These are all cursed weapons?

00:12:16.110 --> 00:12:20.230
Yeah, just like your Azoth Sword,
and my Fallgon.

00:12:20.650 --> 00:12:23.400
They're weapons with lives and wills
of their own.

00:12:23.490 --> 00:12:25.570
But how does a weapon become alive?

00:12:26.410 --> 00:12:29.700
The weapon contains the rage
of those it kills.

00:12:30.120 --> 00:12:33.250
That's what they say,
but nobody knows for sure.

00:12:33.870 --> 00:12:39.050
It's possible that weapons are alive
from the moment they're made.

00:12:39.500 --> 00:12:43.010
For instance, someone holding a weapon
wants to use it, right?

00:12:43.090 --> 00:12:45.050
Like the weapon's controlling them.

00:12:45.970 --> 00:12:49.430
But that doesn't explain
how a weapon could possess someone.

00:12:51.020 --> 00:12:52.560
I still can't believe it.

00:12:54.390 --> 00:12:55.770
But it's true.

00:12:55.850 --> 00:13:00.110
What's happening to us
has befallen others across time.

00:13:00.690 --> 00:13:07.530
Stories of heroes or demon possession
may have been about Chrysalises like us.

00:13:08.910 --> 00:13:10.030
Chrysalis.

00:13:11.790 --> 00:13:13.330
Like a cocoon?

00:13:13.710 --> 00:13:17.170
Right, a chrysalis must sleep
and remain a chrysalis.

00:13:17.920 --> 00:13:21.420
One of the Shoshidai's duties
is to put us to sleep.

00:13:21.500 --> 00:13:25.880
Like how a chrysalis becomes a butterfly,
eventually we'll become Busoma.

00:13:26.010 --> 00:13:28.050
The point is to delay that process.

00:13:28.140 --> 00:13:30.100
What happens if we become Busoma?

00:13:30.810 --> 00:13:33.100
It means the end of your life as a human.

00:13:33.430 --> 00:13:36.890
We lose our own will,
and become the weapon itself,

00:13:37.400 --> 00:13:39.860
with only one thought, to kill.

00:13:40.770 --> 00:13:42.320
To seek slaughter.

00:13:59.130 --> 00:13:59.960
Who's there?

00:14:00.630 --> 00:14:02.380
This place is off-limits!

00:14:08.220 --> 00:14:12.220
There is no place forbidden to me.

00:14:24.570 --> 00:14:27.530
<i>Intruder at central gate!
<i>Level three alert!</i></i>

00:14:27.610 --> 00:14:29.490
<i>I repeat, level three alert!</i>

00:14:29.570 --> 00:14:30.530
Halt!

00:14:44.090 --> 00:14:45.590
He's a monster! Fire!

00:14:57.890 --> 00:14:59.100
Who the hell are you?

00:14:59.190 --> 00:15:01.400
I don't care! Let me out of here!

00:15:01.730 --> 00:15:04.150
-Who are you?
-You're crazy, huh?

00:15:04.230 --> 00:15:06.320
Use that thing to destroy the bars!

00:15:06.400 --> 00:15:07.820
Did you kill the guards?

00:15:07.900 --> 00:15:09.900
Kill, kill! Kill them all!

00:15:11.070 --> 00:15:13.830
Your hatred, your desire to kill.

00:15:13.910 --> 00:15:16.410
They please me. They feed me.

00:15:48.990 --> 00:15:52.320
Number Omega 0702, Naoki Miki.

00:15:52.780 --> 00:15:56.450
Omega 0703, Marcus Lithos.
Initiating cold sleep.

00:15:57.410 --> 00:15:58.240
<i>Mina...</i>

00:15:58.790 --> 00:16:00.790
<i>I hope I dream of you.</i>

00:16:05.880 --> 00:16:10.590
Number Omega 0502, Seiya Ichijo.
Release from cold sleep.

00:16:30.650 --> 00:16:32.860
Gai! Gai!

00:16:36.490 --> 00:16:37.700
What's wrong, miss?

00:16:38.620 --> 00:16:41.290
I can't find Gai.

00:16:41.660 --> 00:16:45.370
Actually, I haven't seen Tatsumi
since yesterday either.

00:16:51.340 --> 00:16:54.630
It hurts. It hurts.

00:17:04.690 --> 00:17:06.100
What's wrong, Bell?

00:17:08.560 --> 00:17:11.320
Bell? Bell!

00:17:16.740 --> 00:17:17.570
Gai!

00:17:18.660 --> 00:17:19.490
Gai!

00:17:24.370 --> 00:17:25.210
Gai?

00:17:37.640 --> 00:17:41.640
Gai! What are you doing hiding there?

00:17:41.720 --> 00:17:42.930
Open up!

00:17:43.890 --> 00:17:45.980
What are you doing, Gai?

00:17:47.100 --> 00:17:48.560
Hey! Gai!

00:17:50.360 --> 00:17:52.320
You're not a little kid!

00:17:54.940 --> 00:17:56.530
Gai! Are you okay?

00:18:28.020 --> 00:18:28.940
Gai.

00:18:29.270 --> 00:18:30.480
What's wrong, Sayaka?

00:18:31.310 --> 00:18:32.270
Father.

00:18:32.820 --> 00:18:35.280
Well, Gai's acting strange.

00:18:41.450 --> 00:18:42.370
Gai.

00:18:48.500 --> 00:18:50.000
That was a great nap.

00:18:50.460 --> 00:18:53.170
How many years have passed
while I've been out?

00:18:54.380 --> 00:18:56.340
Sixteen years and twenty-four days.

00:18:57.210 --> 00:18:58.800
It was long this time, huh?

00:18:59.300 --> 00:19:04.600
But it's not so bad, waking up and
seeing a pretty girl like you first thing.

00:19:05.220 --> 00:19:07.560
Is this a special service from Shoshidai?

00:19:08.350 --> 00:19:10.060
Allow me to introduce myself.

00:19:10.560 --> 00:19:14.110
Kyoka Kagami.
Administrator of Shoshidai Branch 3.

00:19:15.070 --> 00:19:17.820
So you're someone important?
Well, I bet you are.

00:19:18.440 --> 00:19:22.160
Though this place
used to be Miura's jurisdiction.

00:19:23.120 --> 00:19:25.330
What happened? Did he get a promotion?

00:19:26.290 --> 00:19:30.370
You don't need to know that right now.
I have a job for you.

00:19:31.460 --> 00:19:35.340
It must be a big deal if you went
to the trouble of waking me up.

00:19:35.960 --> 00:19:38.670
Yes, you can be certain of that.

00:19:39.760 --> 00:19:43.470
Gai, that's enough! Come out!

00:19:44.430 --> 00:19:45.350
Move.

00:19:47.680 --> 00:19:48.520
Gai.

00:19:51.980 --> 00:19:55.270
Father, what's gotten into Gai?

00:19:56.020 --> 00:19:57.530
He's like a baby.

00:19:58.320 --> 00:20:02.410
That's right.
He's turned back into a baby.

00:20:02.490 --> 00:20:03.610
Why?

00:20:04.160 --> 00:20:06.370
Perhaps he fears the Shiryu's power,

00:20:06.450 --> 00:20:10.750
or rather his own power,
now that he's become one with the Shiryu.

00:20:11.290 --> 00:20:15.670
By reverting back to a baby,
he's escaping from himself.

00:20:37.190 --> 00:20:40.360
Seiya Ichijo's Core Alma
is the Chakram, right?

00:20:40.440 --> 00:20:41.280
Yes.

00:20:41.360 --> 00:20:46.530
Weapon of Vishnu, the highest god
since the dawn of creation, the Chakram.

00:20:59.630 --> 00:21:03.470
Seiya Ichijo is the Man of the Solar Ring,
the Child of God.

00:21:04.300 --> 00:21:06.090
He stands above all else.
